{"name":"Heritage Athletic Club","framework":"html","sourceUrl":"https://21st.dev/community/themes/heritage-athletic-club-1794066020318","license":"Preserve original source terms and notices.","files":[{"path":"theme.css","content":"/* Heritage Athletic Club - shadcn-style theme tokens for the member site (published to 21st.dev) */\n:root {\n  --background: #F4EEE1;\n  --foreground: #1B2233;\n  --card: #FBF8F1;\n  --card-foreground: #1B2233;\n  --popover: #FBF8F1;\n  --popover-foreground: #1B2233;\n  --primary: #14213D;\n  --primary-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --secondary: #EAE0CB;\n  --secondary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --muted: #EAE0CB;\n  --muted-foreground: #5F5A4E;\n  --accent: #C9A45C;\n  --accent-foreground: #14213D;\n  --destructive: #7A1F26;\n  --destructive-foreground: #FBF8F1;\n  --border: #DDD2BA;\n  --input: #DDD2BA;\n  --ring: #B08D57;\n  --chart-1: #14213D;\n  --chart-2: #B08D57;\n  --chart-3: #1F5A3E;\n  --chart-4: #7A1F26;\n  --chart-5: #E3A33B;\n  --radius: 0.875rem;\n  --sidebar: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --sidebar-primary: #C9A45C;\n  --sidebar-primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-accent: #1F3260;\n  --sidebar-accent-foreground: #E9CF8F;\n  --sidebar-border: #2B3A5C;\n  --sidebar-ring: #C9A45C;\n}\n.dark {\n  --background: #0F1A2E;\n  --foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --card: #14213D;\n  --card-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --popover: #14213D;\n  --popover-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --primary: #C9A45C;\n  --primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --secondary: #1F3260;\n  --secondary-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --muted: #1A2846;\n  --muted-foreground: #B9B09E;\n  --accent: #E9CF8F;\n  --accent-foreground: #14213D;\n  --destructive: #C0505A;\n  --destructive-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --border: #2B3A5C;\n  --input: #2B3A5C;\n  --ring: #C9A45C;\n  --chart-1: #C9A45C;\n  --chart-2: #E9CF8F;\n  --chart-3: #4FA27A;\n  --chart-4: #C0505A;\n  --chart-5: #E3A33B;\n  --radius: 0.875rem;\n  --sidebar: #0D1730;\n  --sidebar-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --sidebar-primary: #C9A45C;\n  --sidebar-primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-accent: #1F3260;\n  --sidebar-accent-foreground: #E9CF8F;\n  --sidebar-border: #2B3A5C;\n  --sidebar-ring: #C9A45C;\n}\n"},{"path":"preview.html","content":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Heritage Athletic Club</title><style>/* Heritage Athletic Club - shadcn-style theme tokens for the member site (published to 21st.dev) */\n:root {\n  --background: #F4EEE1;\n  --foreground: #1B2233;\n  --card: #FBF8F1;\n  --card-foreground: #1B2233;\n  --popover: #FBF8F1;\n  --popover-foreground: #1B2233;\n  --primary: #14213D;\n  --primary-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --secondary: #EAE0CB;\n  --secondary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --muted: #EAE0CB;\n  --muted-foreground: #5F5A4E;\n  --accent: #C9A45C;\n  --accent-foreground: #14213D;\n  --destructive: #7A1F26;\n  --destructive-foreground: #FBF8F1;\n  --border: #DDD2BA;\n  --input: #DDD2BA;\n  --ring: #B08D57;\n  --chart-1: #14213D;\n  --chart-2: #B08D57;\n  --chart-3: #1F5A3E;\n  --chart-4: #7A1F26;\n  --chart-5: #E3A33B;\n  --radius: 0.875rem;\n  --sidebar: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --sidebar-primary: #C9A45C;\n  --sidebar-primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-accent: #1F3260;\n  --sidebar-accent-foreground: #E9CF8F;\n  --sidebar-border: #2B3A5C;\n  --sidebar-ring: #C9A45C;\n}\n.dark {\n  --background: #0F1A2E;\n  --foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --card: #14213D;\n  --card-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --popover: #14213D;\n  --popover-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --primary: #C9A45C;\n  --primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --secondary: #1F3260;\n  --secondary-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --muted: #1A2846;\n  --muted-foreground: #B9B09E;\n  --accent: #E9CF8F;\n  --accent-foreground: #14213D;\n  --destructive: #C0505A;\n  --destructive-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --border: #2B3A5C;\n  --input: #2B3A5C;\n  --ring: #C9A45C;\n  --chart-1: #C9A45C;\n  --chart-2: #E9CF8F;\n  --chart-3: #4FA27A;\n  --chart-4: #C0505A;\n  --chart-5: #E3A33B;\n  --radius: 0.875rem;\n  --sidebar: #0D1730;\n  --sidebar-foreground: #F4EEE1;\n  --sidebar-primary: #C9A45C;\n  --sidebar-primary-foreground: #14213D;\n  --sidebar-accent: #1F3260;\n  --sidebar-accent-foreground: #E9CF8F;\n  --sidebar-border: #2B3A5C;\n  --sidebar-ring: #C9A45C;\n}\n</style><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground);font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui);padding:clamp(18px,5vw,64px)}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-bottom:38px}h1{font-size:38px;margin:8px 0;letter-spacing:-.04em}p{line-height:1.6}small{color:var(--muted-foreground)}section{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:var(--card);color:var(--card-foreground);padding:26px;min-width:0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.swatches{display:flex;gap:10px;margin:24px 0}.swatches i{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:var(--radius,8px);border:1px solid var(--border)}button,input,select{font:inherit;border-radius:var(--radius,8px);padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border)}button{cursor:pointer;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground)}button.secondary{background:var(--secondary);color:var(--secondary-foreground)}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ring);outline-offset:3px}label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin:20px 0}input,select{width:100%;background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground)}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}output{display:block;margin-top:15px;color:var(--muted-foreground)}@media(max-width:600px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}h1{font-size:28px}header{align-items:flex-start}}</style></head><body><main><header><div><small>CORES E TIPOGRAFIA</small><h1>Heritage Athletic Club</h1><p>Experimente os tokens deste tema.</p></div><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"theme\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Alternar tema</button></header><div class=\"grid\"><section><h2>Seu próximo projeto</h2><p>Uma paleta aplicada a elementos reais da interface.</p><div class=\"swatches\" aria-label=\"Cores do tema\"><i style=\"background:var(--primary)\"></i><i style=\"background:var(--secondary)\"></i><i style=\"background:var(--accent)\"></i><i style=\"background:var(--destructive)\"></i></div><label>Nome do projeto<input placeholder=\"Minha próxima ideia\"></label><label>Categoria<select><option>Aplicativo</option><option>Portfólio</option><option>Loja</option></select></label><div class=\"actions\"><button id=\"save\">Salvar projeto</button><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"reset\">Limpar</button></div><output id=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></output></section><section><h2>Configurações</h2><p>Ajuste as opções e confira o contraste da paleta.</p><label>Notificações<input type=\"checkbox\" checked></label><label>Intensidade<input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"65\"></label><p>Texto de apoio e estados de foco usam os tokens originais.</p></section></div></main><script>document.querySelector('#theme').onclick=e=>{const dark=document.documentElement.classList.toggle('dark');e.currentTarget.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(dark))};document.querySelector('#save').onclick=()=>document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Projeto salvo nesta demonstração.';document.querySelector('#reset').onclick=()=>{document.querySelector('input').value='';document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Campos limpos.'};</script></body></html>"}]}